# Kaito, Cunning Infiltrator reaches 9 loyalty and uses -9. Turn 1: Kaito enters with 3, +1 (no target) with a loot makes 4.
# Turn 3: +1 targeting Llanowar Elves (it can't be blocked this turn, checked mid-turn) makes 5, and the Elves hit Bot2:
# "Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player" puts a counter on Kaito, 6. Turn 5: +1 makes 7 and
# both Elves connect, one trigger for each creature, 9. Turn 7: -9 takes Kaito to 0 (he dies) and gives Bot1 the emblem
# (only one loyalty ability a turn, so it waits for the next turn). The Ornithopter Bot1 casts afterwards, and the one Bot2
# casts on turn 8, each make Bot1 a 2/1 blue Ninja: the emblem is Bot1's, "a player" is anyone, and "you" is its owner.

